#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Juno — the daemon half of the Omarchy voice assistant.

Owns the microphone, the wake word, the speech models, and the Claude
session. Publishes a newline-JSON event stream over a unix socket and
accepts newline-JSON commands on the same socket. The QML overlay is a
pure subscriber: it can crash, reload, or be closed entirely without the
daemon losing the conversation or stopping listening for the wake word.

Pipeline:

    pw-record --raw ──► 20ms frames ──► energy VAD ──► utterance
                             │                              │
                        level events                   whisper-server
                       (UI visualizer)                      │
                                                     ┌──────┴──────┐
                                            state=IDLE        state=LISTENING
                                            fuzzy wake match   the command
                                                     │              │
                                                     └────► claude -p ──► TTS

Silence costs nothing: the VAD is arithmetic on 320 samples, and whisper
only ever sees audio that already passed it.
"""

